---
/** The path of one search through the layers (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md). Numbers come from there. */
import { PACK_FACTS } from "./facts";
---

<figure class="docs-layers">
  <ol>
    <li>
      <span class="docs-layers-mark emoji" aria-hidden="true">📱</span>
      <span class="docs-layers-text">
        <strong>On the device</strong>
        <span>The alias dictionary answers every keystroke: slang, names, typos, {PACK_FACTS.languages} languages. Works offline.</span>
      </span>
      <span class="docs-layers-facts"><span>p95 0.4 ms</span><span>free</span></span>
    </li>
    <li class="docs-layers-hop" aria-hidden="true"><span>unsure, or a phrase</span></li>
    <li>
      <span class="docs-layers-mark emoji" aria-hidden="true">🗂️</span>
      <span class="docs-layers-text">
        <strong>Precomputed shards</strong>
        <span>Static files with answers for frequent queries. One download per prefix, then local.</span>
      </span>
      <span class="docs-layers-facts"><span>optional</span><span>free</span></span>
    </li>
    <li class="docs-layers-hop" aria-hidden="true"><span>no shard answer</span></li>
    <li>
      <span class="docs-layers-mark emoji" aria-hidden="true">⚡</span>
      <span class="docs-layers-text">
        <strong>Edge meaning search</strong>
        <span>A Cloudflare Worker embeds the query with Workers AI and caches the answer in each data center.</span>
      </span>
      <span class="docs-layers-facts"><span>≈ 50 ms</span><span>metered</span></span>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <figcaption>
    <span class="emoji" aria-hidden="true">🛟</span> Over a plan limit, search stays on the device and the shards. It never
    fails.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .docs-layers {
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    padding: 0.5rem;
    border: 0.0625rem solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--bg-soft);
  }

  ol {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  li {
    margin: 0;
  }

  li:not(.docs-layers-hop) {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.25rem 0.875rem;
    align-items: start;
    padding: 0.875rem 1rem;
    border: 0.0625rem solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  .docs-layers-mark {
    grid-row: span 2;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 2.5rem;
    height: 2.5rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    font-size: 1.375rem;
  }

  .docs-layers-text {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.125rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .docs-layers-text strong {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .docs-layers-facts {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.375rem;
  }

  .docs-layers-facts span {
    padding: 0.1875rem 0.5rem;
    border: 0.0625rem solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--pill);
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font: 500 0.75rem / 1.2 var(--font-mono);
  }

  .docs-layers-hop {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.375rem 0 0.375rem 2.125rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font: 400 0.75rem / 1.2 var(--font-mono);
  }

  .docs-layers-hop::before {
    content: "↓";
    color: var(--ink-3);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  figcaption {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 0.75rem 0.75rem 0.375rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 40rem) {
    li:not(.docs-layers-hop) {
      grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .docs-layers-mark {
      grid-row: auto;
    }

    .docs-layers-facts {
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }
  }
</style>
